  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Zelia Spencer",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:04:13-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:04:17-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good afternoon. Um, I am calling about the power. My mother's lights, they go out, and I want to report it. This is the electric company, yes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:04:25-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, no, I'm sorry. This is the City Clerk at Newport City Hall. We don't handle the electric service. You'd want the electric utility directly, they have an outage line."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:04:34-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, okay. [pause] I think I dial from an old list. Maybe the list is older than me, you know? Is a joke."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:04:41-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That happens. Lots of numbers change. The best thing is to look at the most recent bill or the utility's website for the outage reporting number. Or search the company name and outage."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:04:51-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, I will do that. I work overnight, security guard at an office park, so I am sleeping before and I did not see the bill. I will look now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:05:00-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That sounds like a plan. Sorry I couldn't help directly with that one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:05:05-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, is okay. Thank you for your patience. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:05:09-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Take care, and I hope the power's back soon."
    }
  ],
